  "releaseNotes": "### 🆕 Additions\n- Added `IRetryClassifier`\n\n### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Narrowed exception catches and tightened the middleware chain.\n\n### 🗑️ Removals\n- Removed `ShouldRetry` from `IProcessResultValidator`. Validators now only validate; the retry classifier decides retries.\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed null-unsafe equality operators on primitives.\n- Fixed a duplicate in `GetHashCode` in `ProcessExitConfiguration`",
